  "description": "In today’s digital landscape, most media platforms revolve around videos, pictures, and livestreams. But there lacks the initiative to create communities that bond over literature, especially where such literature can be shared in new and unique ways. Modern platforms often prioritize passive consumption over genuine connections. Our goal is to bring back the social in social media by empowering users to share their stories, ideas, and imaginations in new formats.",
